{
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.3,
      "text": "In this town, everybody is out partying, except me."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.52,
      "end": 4.06,
      "text": "Hush, hush, hush, hush, hush, hush."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.4,
      "end": 5.38,
      "text": "They will party for anything."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.7,
      "end": 7.94,
      "text": "A birthday, a Tuesday, once because somebody"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.94,
      "end": 8.66,
      "text": "found a nice rock."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.0,
      "end": 10.44,
      "text": "While they are out partying, by the way,"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.56,
      "end": 12.66,
      "text": "I am in here, preparing for my job interview."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.88,
      "end": 14.38,
      "text": "Hush, hush, hush, hush, hush, hush."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.7,
      "end": 16.64,
      "text": "The job is wrapping burgers at Bun Town."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.98,
      "end": 17.44,
      "text": "So I train."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.66,
      "end": 18.88,
      "text": "5 AM, wrist stretches."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.16,
      "end": 20.34,
      "text": "200 wraps before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.7,
      "end": 21.42,
      "text": "I do not eat breakfast."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.66,
      "end": 22.16,
      "text": "I wrap it."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.38,
      "end": 23.76,
      "text": "Fold, fold, tuck, roll."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.0,
      "end": 24.94,
      "text": "Four seconds, too slow."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.18,
      "end": 26.66,
      "text": "Hush, hush, hush, hush, hush."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.96,
      "end": 27.62,
      "text": "I wrap the burger."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.82,
      "end": 28.32,
      "text": "I wrap the plate."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.5,
      "end": 29.4,
      "text": "I wrap my neighbor's cat."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.4,
      "end": 30.14,
      "text": "The cat is fine."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.36,
      "end": 30.94,
      "text": "The cat is warm."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.34,
      "end": 32.98,
      "text": "My neighbor has a party every single night."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.14,
      "end": 33.88,
      "text": "Come out, he says."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.12,
      "end": 34.82,
      "text": "You only live once."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.14,
      "end": 35.46,
      "text": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.78,
      "end": 36.9,
      "text": "One life, one interview."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.24,
      "end": 38.74,
      "text": "Hush, hush, hush, hush, hush, hush."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.02,
      "end": 40.48,
      "text": "Fold, fold, tuck, roll."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.64,
      "end": 41.6,
      "text": "Two seconds, one second."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.78,
      "end": 43.26,
      "text": "I stopped being able to see my own hands."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.48,
      "end": 44.46,
      "text": "Then came the interview."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.64,
      "end": 46.1,
      "text": "The manager put one burger on the counter."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.3,
      "end": 47.34,
      "text": "Whenever you are ready, he said."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.58,
      "end": 48.28,
      "text": "It was already wrapped."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.6,
      "end": 49.32,
      "text": "So was his clipboard."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.5,
      "end": 50.06,
      "text": "So was his tie."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.36,
      "end": 50.82,
      "text": "He was impressed."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.06,
      "end": 51.48,
      "text": "I could tell."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.72,
      "end": 52.84,
      "text": "Then he asked me one question."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.0,
      "end": 53.66,
      "text": "Can you cook a burger?"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.94,
      "end": 54.96,
      "text": "I have never cooked a burger."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.14,
      "end": 56.16,
      "text": "I have never even eaten one."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.32,
      "end": 56.94,
      "text": "I only wrap."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.52,
      "end": 58.48,
      "text": "I did not get the job."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.48,
      "end": 60.54,
      "text": "The letter said, thank you for wrapping my tie."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.46,
      "end": 63.18,
      "text": "Almost, almost."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.34,
      "end": 66.28,
      "text": "So tonight, while they are out partying, by the way,"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.42,
      "end": 67.96,
      "text": "I am back in here, learning to cook."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.22,
      "end": 70.08,
      "text": "5 AM, 200 burgers before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.42,
      "end": 72.1,
      "text": "Hush, hush, hush, hush, hush, hush, hush."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.12,
      "end": 73.1,
      "text": "You are hired, he said."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.26,
      "end": 73.8,
      "text": "When can you start?"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.04,
      "end": 74.82,
      "text": "I had already started."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.12,
      "end": 77.34,
      "text": "My first shift was Saturday night, the biggest party"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.34,
      "end": 77.82,
      "text": "of the year."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.08,
      "end": 79.66,
      "text": "At midnight, the whole town walked in."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.78,
      "end": 81.56,
      "text": "Hungry, 400 people, one of me."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.82,
      "end": 83.38,
      "text": "Hush, hush, hush, hush, hush, hush, hush."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.5,
      "end": 85.06,
      "text": "400 burgers, one minute."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.26,
      "end": 86.14,
      "text": "The mayor stared at me."
    },
    {
      "start": 86.26,
      "end": 87.06,
      "text": "How did you do that?"
    },
    {
      "start": 87.32,
      "end": 88.24,
      "text": "While you were out partying,"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.24,
      "end": 91.06,
      "text": "I said, by the way, hush, hush, hush, hush, hush, hush, hush."
    }
  ],
